OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy evening with some
OL,7,Fshowers, perhaps heavy. Then becoming
OL,8,Fdrier in the early hours with just the
OL,9,Fodd shower in the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA mainly dry morning then
OL,12,Fshowers or longer spells of rain
OL,13,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Fresh to
OL,14,Fstrong southwest winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBright
OL,17,Fbut showery on Tuesday with strong
OL,18,Fwinds. Dry with some sunshine on
OL,19,FWednesday. Rain spreading from west on
OL,20,FThursday.
